power right and i know how you can get
it but the first thing you need to do is

250
00:16:02,580 --> 00:16:09,100
stop expecting your friends to rescue you
all those blokes seem to do is disappoint

251
00:16:10,040 --> 00:16:11,480
So come with me.

252
00:16:11,780 --> 00:16:16,000
The answer to all your problems is
right around the corner. Trust me.

253
00:16:17,060 --> 00:16:19,560
All you have to do is take my hand.

254
00:16:19,760 --> 00:16:22,407
You'll be the most
powerful duelist on earth.

255
00:16:22,820 --> 00:16:23,780
What do you say?

256
00:16:27,900 --> 00:16:30,660
That was the smartest decision of my life.

257
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:34,480
I stopped whining like a loser
and started taking control.

258
00:16:34,920 --> 00:16:36,680
Now nothing can stop me.

259
00:16:37,260 --> 00:16:39,160
I never knew you felt that way.

260
00:16:39,500 --> 00:16:41,737
Why didn't you tell us
you were so unhappy?

261
00:16:41,820 --> 00:16:44,380
We could have helped you, Mai. Save it.

262
00:16:44,540 --> 00:16:46,364
I don't need your kind of help.

263
00:16:46,580 --> 00:16:48,380
All I need now is power.

264
00:16:48,640 --> 00:16:51,320
And I'm about to unleash all of it on you.

265
00:16:52,100 --> 00:16:55,180
I play Harpy Lady Phoenix Formation.

266
00:16:55,680 --> 00:16:57,960
Since I have six harpies on the field,

267
00:16:58,200 --> 00:17:00,906
it lets me destroy up
to six of your monsters.

268
00:17:01,600 --> 00:17:02,520
Hold on.

269
00:17:02,920 --> 00:17:04,577
Joey's only got three left.

270
00:17:04,660 --> 00:17:08,860
That means once Mai's Harpy Lady's
attack, he'll be defenseless.

271
00:17:09,320 --> 00:17:10,460
That's not all.

272
00:17:11,060 --> 00:17:13,437
Mai's magic card will
also subtract the sum of

273
00:17:13,520 --> 00:17:16,580
Joey's monster's attack
points from his life points.

274
00:17:18,260 --> 00:17:23,500
Now, Harpy Lady's, unite and
destroy every one of his monsters!

275
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:32,720
Say goodbye to your
three monsters, Wheeler.

276
00:17:41,160 --> 00:17:44,101
Someone is one attack away
from losing their soul,

277
00:17:44,280 --> 00:17:46,515
and I don't think it's me, sweetheart.

278
00:17:47,020 --> 00:17:48,120
Any last requests?

279
00:17:49,300 --> 00:17:51,480
Mai's got 4,000 points!

280
00:17:51,740 --> 00:17:53,380
She hasn't even lost one!

281
00:17:53,620 --> 00:17:55,600
And Joey's down to his last 200!

282
00:17:56,300 --> 00:17:59,241
Not to mention the fact
that he's out of monsters.

283
00:17:59,940 --> 00:18:03,377
If he doesn't think of something
right now, he's gonna lose the duel!

284
00:18:03,460 --> 00:18:05,620
Yugi, is there anything he can do?

285
00:18:05,900 --> 00:18:09,620
He must find a way to break
the seal of Orichalcos.

286
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:14,460
The magic within that card has
infused Mai with a powerful force.

287
00:18:15,300 --> 00:18:19,160
And unless Joey stops it,
the seal will consume him.

288
00:18:19,480 --> 00:18:20,700
No, he can't.

289
00:18:20,840 --> 00:18:24,280
If he does that, then
won't Mai lose her soul?

290
00:18:24,780 --> 00:18:28,820
There's gotta be a way for Joey
to win this duel and save Mai.

291
00:18:29,580 --> 00:18:31,020
That kid stinks.

292
00:18:31,340 --> 00:18:33,157
Yeah, he didn't even put up a fight.

293
00:18:33,240 --> 00:18:37,064
and according to the hype, he's
supposed to be good at this game.

294
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:37,990
What a waste.

295
00:18:38,120 --> 00:18:41,020
Master Darts wants the
souls of strong duelists.

296
00:18:42,200 --> 00:18:43,030
All right.

297
00:18:43,260 --> 00:18:44,940
I'm officially out of ideas.

298
00:18:45,540 --> 00:18:49,480
Behind that black leather and
nasty attitude is my friend.

299
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:54,019
And there's no way I'm going to
fight back and risk losing her again.

300
00:18:56,260 --> 00:18:59,420
With 200 life points left,
there's no way I can win.

301
00:19:00,060 --> 00:19:04,080
But if I give up my soul to save
hers, maybe she'll see the light.

302
00:19:04,600 --> 00:19:05,580
I quit!

303
00:19:06,100 --> 00:19:06,930
Joey, no!

304
00:19:07,200 --> 00:19:08,040
Don't do it!

305
00:19:09,320 --> 00:19:11,026
Forfeiting is not the answer.

306
00:19:11,180 --> 00:19:15,117
If you give up the duel, you're giving
up on yourself and your friends.

307
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:17,840
If you want to save
Mai, then keep fighting!

308
00:19:18,780 --> 00:19:19,610
You sure?

309
00:19:20,260 --> 00:19:25,260
Yes, because right now Mai is driven
by anger, jealousy, and hatred.

310
00:19:25,840 --> 00:19:29,016
So you need to remind her
what dueling is truly about.

311
00:19:29,420 --> 00:19:31,940
Trust, conviction, and heart.

312
00:19:32,540 --> 00:19:33,370
He's right.

313
00:19:33,920 --> 00:19:35,740
I forgot what really matters.

314
00:19:36,180 --> 00:19:38,180
I forgot the heart of the cards.

315
00:19:39,120 --> 00:19:41,060
This duel's still on, Mai.

316
00:19:41,380 --> 00:19:44,280
And from now on, I'm
giving it everything I got.

317
00:19:44,700 --> 00:19:45,960
It's my move!

318
00:19:47,380 --> 00:19:50,600
Time to show you what
true dueling is all about!

319
00:20:00,100 --> 00:20:01,500
Yahoo!
